7. Defects Found: holes by location, and visual defects by class with the count against accept and reject.
8. Inspector Comments: the inspector's comments, in short, given as the inspector's observations.
9. Sections Switched Off: sections left out of this inspection, with the reason.
10. Next Step: one closing sentence on what the conclusion means for the lot, going no further than the conclusion. Never promise shipment, release or approval. Leave it out while any section is not done.
